---

FolkTech AI was born from one man’s obsession with building smarter, safer, and more ethical AI. Mike, a paramedic and developer, blended his life-saving instincts with engineering vision. His first mission: AI that could protect elders from falls — and do it privately, locally, securely.

But FolkTech didn’t stop at fall detection. It branched into assistants, memory tools, codexes, and education systems. It built Serena. It built Jake. And above all, it built a system where human empathy and AI logic coexisted.

